    "display_name": "Transit Stops",
    "long_instructions": "## Analyze Data\r\n\r\n### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. Look through the `stops` array.\r\n2. Count how many stops belong to each line.\r\n3. Look at the `neighborhood` field across the dataset.\r\n4. Compare the `notes` field across stops.\r\n\r\n### **Reflect:**\r\n\r\n- Which transit line appears most often?\r\n- Which appears least?\r\n- What patterns do you notice about neighborhoods?\r\n- Which stops have more detailed notes? Which have less?",
